think Read recursion-prompts/diffuser-inner.md whole. The 20261002.183518 ruling closed the arena-tail-free arc and named the next fruit as awaiting the captain's word. Fourteen consecutive fallow readings since then (session-logs/date/20261002/*fallow-reading*) recorded the same unchanged state each time.
think The baton's own closing paragraph for this ship names the mandate directly: "Your lane is MOONSHOTS AND RESEARCH, and you are expected to generate them yourself rather than wait to be handed one." Fourteen readings of waiting is past the point this mandate tolerates, since nearly every other entry in diffuser-inner.md's own history is marked Self-generated rather than Ruled. Chose to self-generate rather than write a fifteenth fallow reading.
